# AMT Imaging Service App — local/dev notes
# Copy this file only as a reminder. Do not put secrets in git, GitHub Pages, or a committed .env.
#
# Default local run (python3 scripts/serve.py) talks to HOSTED Firebase
# project amt-imaging-service-app — the same project as production Pages.
# No environment variables are required to serve or edit the UI.
#
# Optional functions emulator (Ask Grok source without deploying):
#   AMT_FUNCTIONS_EMULATOR_HOST=127.0.0.1
#   AMT_FUNCTIONS_EMULATOR_PORT=5001
# Then open http://127.0.0.1:8080/?functionsEmulator=1
# Put the xAI key in gitignored functions/.secret.local — never here.
#
# Never commit or paste:
#   XAI_API_KEY
#   Firebase Admin / service-account JSON
#   GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS pointing at a file in this repo
#   GitHub PATs, staff PINs
